        if span_id not in spans_by_id:
            log.warning("citations.span_not_found", span_id=span_id, feature="citations")
            continue
        span, pol = spans_by_id[span_id]
        cit = Citation(id=f"cit_{briefing_id}_{span_id}", briefing_id=...,
                       span=SpanRef(span_id=span.id, surface=span.section),
                       resolved_text=span.text, source_url=pol.source_url)
        resolved.append(cit)
        self._span_cache[span_id] = cit
```

**CitationDetail schema**: `{text: str, source_url: str, section: str}` — slimmer than `Citation`, no `briefing_id` noise for the FE click-to-inspect use case.

**Acceptance tests (F5)**:
